Subject: Files Hex includes by path from kiln's copies
Why: hex-sim includes hyper-swim's coordinates.rs, and hex-gpu cuda-rust's loader and all-smi's AMD readers, by path from Hex's own vendor/ folder; kiln's copy leaves those copies out for kiln's own (vendor/hyper-raft, vendor/cuda-rust, vendor/all-smi), so the paths name those.
Kiln-only: kiln's layout: Hex's tree holds its copies at vendor/ inside it

